Subject: [PATCH 5/5] M4 R2.1: survivor test, tighter allowance, mutation
 analysis and evidence

- M4R21RegressionTest.subnormalSpeedLongRange (5 tests in the class): kills
  mutant M50; dv no longer carries MIN_VALUE (the R2.1 rule never rounds a
  subnormal speed product), a tighter allowance.
- Mutation analysis of the R2.1 reference: 55 mutants, 50 killed,
  4 equivalent, 1 tolerance-equivalent.
- Full suite against the R2.1 reference on Java 25: 313/313; before/after
  against R1 and R2; reference values compared bit for bit with R2.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
